  Note: 'Water treatment plant or facility master record. Stores facility-level attributes including design capacity, treatment technology, regulatory identifiers (PWSID), SCADA integration points, operator certification requirements, and AWIA risk assessment dates. Central entity for treatment operations, compliance reporting (MOR/DMR), and asset management integration (Maximo location). References EPA SDWA, AWIA Section 2013.'
